GCP Cloud Run Canary & Event-Driven Architecture

Hands-on Google Cloud project demonstrating Cloud Run deployments, canary releases, traffic splitting, and event-driven processing with Eventarc.

Technologies

* Google Cloud Run
* Cloud Run Revisions & Traffic Splitting
* Eventarc
* Cloud Logging
* Git / Gitea

What I Implemented

* Deployed an application to Cloud Run using multiple revisions.
* Implemented a 90/10 canary deployment between revisions.
* Promoted the new revision to 100% production traffic.
* Configured Eventarc to trigger Cloud Run from cloud events.
* Verified event delivery through Cloud Run logs.

Key Concepts

Serverless deployment · Canary releases · Progressive delivery · Traffic management · Event-driven architecture · Cloud logging
